cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this resource, please cite it as below.
title: "SSK-GAIN: A Cross-Domain Ontology and Entity Catalogue for Semiconductor Global Supply Chain Geopolitics"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 ontology in four modules (core, international relations, supply
  chain, cross-domain bridge) with SHACL shapes, an instantiated and
  machine-validated entity catalogue, and the validation toolkit that
  reproduces every reported check.
type: dataset
